Alias pi0sig pi0

Decay Upsilon(4S)
1.0 B0 anti-B0 B0-sig anti-B0sig  VSS_BMIX dm;
Enddecay
### 
Decay anti-B0sig
1.0  Lambda_c+sig anti-p- pi0sig PHSP;
Enddecay
CDecay B0sig
###
Decay Lambda_c+sig
1.0   p+  K-  pi+                                  PHSP;  
Enddecay
CDecay anti-Lambda_c-sig
### 
Decay pi0sig
1.0 gamma gamma PHSP;
Enddecay
### 
End

